  "description": "The dashboard identified by UID **dash1234ab** is titled **Server Metrics Overview** and carries the tags *servers*, *metrics* and *performance*. It uses the dark theme, is set to the UTC timezone, and is fully editable with controls displayed (hideControls\u202f=\u202ffalse). The dashboard is not starred and its internal identifier is currently null. A shared cross\u2011hair tooltip is enabled (graphTooltip\u202f=\u202f1). Two panels make up the view: Panel\u202f1 (id\u202f1) is a **graph** called *CPU Usage* positioned at grid coordinates\u202fx\u202f0,\u202fy\u202f0, spanning\u202fw\u202f12 columns and\u202fh\u202f8 rows; Panel\u202f2 (id\u202f2) is a **table** named *Disk I/O* placed at\u202fx\u202f12,\u202fy\u202f0 with the same width and height (12\u202f\u00d7\u202f8). The time range is set from **now\u20116h** to **now**.  \n\nThe timepicker is active (enable\u202f=\u202ftrue), not collapsed, shows the \u201cNow\u201d button, has no notice flag, and offers refresh intervals of **5\u202fs**, **1\u202fm** and **5\u202fm**; its status reads *Active* and its type is *default*. Templating is enabled with a single variable called **instance** of type *query*. The variable uses the wildcard format for the \u201cAll\u201d option (value\u202f$__all), includes an All entry, permits multiple selections (multi\u202f=\u202ftrue) and formats selections as *regex values*. No datasource is specified, refresh on change is disabled, and no regex filter is applied. Available options are *server\u201101*, *server\u201102* and *server\u201103* (none are pre\u2011selected). Annotations are presently empty, auto\u2011refresh is set to **5\u202fs**, the schema version is\u202f30, the dashboard version is\u202f3, and there are no external links. The dashboard is not marked for overwrite (overwrite\u202f=\u202ffalse)."
